# Liquid glass panels

App-wide content panels use `liquidPanelClass` (`src/lib/liquid-panel.ts`) via default `Card` / `SectionPanel`.

- Do **not** apply liquid glass to form controls, dropdown menus, or modal overlays (keep opaque `bg-surface`).
- Pass `solid` on `Card` when opaque is required (e.g. login card).
- Sidebar chrome stays solid `bg-primary`; nav items use `.sidebar-nav-liquid` on hover/active only.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` / `motion-reduce:backdrop-blur-none`.
